OL,3,GNEWSAParent concern over lack of funds
OL,4,Afor school trips
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have called out the need for
OL,7,F"last-minute crowd funding" for school
OL,8,Ftrips, saying more funds should be made
OL,9,Favailable to cover costs.
OL,11,FTwo Present Grange Primary School mums,
OL,12,Ffrom North Tyneside, have voiced their
OL,13,Fworries about children missing out on
OL,14,Fvisits and outdoor education amid
OL,15,Fseveral cancelled trips.
OL,17,FA trip to the Rising Sun Country Park
OL,18,Fwas initially put in jeopardy after the
OL,19,Fschool was unable to raise sufficient
OL,20,Ffunds to cover the costs, but parents
OL,21,Fstepped in to help fund it.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
