OL,3,GNEWSAParent concern over lack of funds
OL,4,Afor school trips
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeadteacher Tracey A Taylor said
OL,7,Ffunding issues facing "all schools"
OL,8,Fmeans they have had to ask parents for
OL,9,Fvoluntary donations. The government
OL,10,Fsaid it was putting "record investment"
OL,11,Finto schools.
